        "doi": "10.1111/j.1365-2125.2005.02467.x",
        "title": "Fluvoxamine impairs single-dose caffeine clearance without altering caffeine pharmacodynamics.",
        "authorString": "Culm-Merdek KE, von Moltke LL, Harmatz JS, Greenblatt DJ.",
